WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.539 --> 00:00:20.681
Ben looked at Gaby and Mog, and then at Waldo and Winnie.

2
00:00:22.623 --> 00:00:26.045
Gaby was his best friend, but Winnie was his girlfriend.

3
00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:29.728
Choosing teams was not going to be easy.

4
00:00:30.752 --> 00:00:33.533
Ben stared down at his half-eaten toad toes.

5
00:00:33.553 --> 00:00:38.075
"I'll help everybody," he blurted out.

6
00:00:38.095 --> 00:00:41.116
"It's just a friendly bet anyway."

7
00:00:41.136 --> 00:00:43.997
"Yeah," Mog said.

8
00:00:44.017 --> 00:00:46.458
"It's like a scavenger hunt.

9
00:00:46.839 --> 00:00:48.839
We'll see who finds the treasure first."

10
00:00:48.859 --> 00:00:51.240
"It's going to be us!"

11
00:00:51.661 --> 00:00:52.701
Gaby said, grinning.

12
00:00:53.461 --> 00:00:54.482
Then she looked at Ben.

13
00:00:54.502 --> 00:00:57.503
"But no sharing team secrets, okay, Ben?"

14
00:00:58.403 --> 00:00:59.704
Ben held up his hands.

15
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.221
"No problem."

16
00:01:02.282 --> 00:01:03.743
"Who are you going to help first, Ben?"

17
00:01:04.083 --> 00:01:04.764
Winnie asked.

18
00:01:04.784 --> 00:01:09.167
"I'll decide after I finish my lunch," Ben said quickly.

19
00:01:09.187 --> 00:01:13.450
"We have study hall after lunch," Gaby said to Mog.

20
00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:16.593
"Let's go to the library now and get started.

21
00:01:17.053 --> 00:01:20.536
We can read about Monsterville history—that's the best place to start."

22
00:01:20.556 --> 00:01:23.078
"Okay," Mog said.

23
00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:30.783
The two of them returned their trays to the kitchen and hurried off to the library.

24
00:01:32.144 --> 00:01:32.924
Winnie stood up.

25
00:01:32.944 --> 00:01:34.245
"Come on, Waldo.

26
00:01:34.625 --> 00:01:35.686
We have to get started too.

27
00:01:36.187 --> 00:01:38.088
Let's go to the lab and figure out a spell.

28
00:01:40.349 --> 00:01:41.090
See you later, Ben."

29
00:01:44.372 --> 00:01:46.353
Ben sighed as the two of them left.

30
00:01:46.373 --> 00:01:50.837
"This situation stinks," he thought.

31
00:01:52.598 --> 00:01:54.399
Somebody was bound to get mad at him.

32
00:01:58.688 --> 00:02:02.610
Finally he decided he wasn't hungry anymore, so he picked up his tray.

33
00:02:03.651 --> 00:02:06.812
As he headed toward the garbage can, a blob waved to him.

34
00:02:06.832 --> 00:02:10.374
"Hey, Ben, are you going to eat those toad toes?

35
00:02:10.735 --> 00:02:12.576
I'm really hungry today."

36
00:02:12.596 --> 00:02:16.137
"Nope. You can have them," Ben said.

37
00:02:16.157 --> 00:02:19.119
"Just return my tray to the kitchen when you're done, okay?"

38
00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:22.461
"Don't worry about that," the blob said.

39
00:02:22.481 --> 00:02:24.262
"I'll eat the tray too!"

40
00:02:28.216 --> 00:02:28.816
Ben said.

41
00:02:29.556 --> 00:02:30.697
But he didn't feel great.

42
00:02:31.197 --> 00:02:34.098
If only Gaby and Waldo hadn't made this stupid bet!

43
00:02:36.218 --> 00:02:39.519
A few minutes later, Ben floated through the door of the science lab.

44
00:02:39.539 --> 00:02:42.000
"How's it going in here?"

45
00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:42.820
he said.

46
00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.101
Winnie looked up and smiled.

47
00:02:46.041 --> 00:02:50.462
She was stirring a potion in a big cauldron as Waldo handed her some ingredients.

48
00:02:53.403 --> 00:02:56.504
The liquid inside the pot glowed green as Winnie mixed it.

49
00:02:58.776 --> 00:03:01.437
"We're brewing a location spell," she said.

50
00:03:01.458 --> 00:03:03.118
"Can I help?"

51
00:03:03.579 --> 00:03:04.299
Ben asked.

52
00:03:04.319 --> 00:03:09.302
"Sure." Winnie gestured toward some supplies on a high shelf.

53
00:03:09.322 --> 00:03:13.464
"Can you hand Waldo that big sack of lizard scales?"

54
00:03:22.709 --> 00:03:24.070
green ones or the gold ones?"

55
00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:25.150
Ben asked.

56
00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:28.172
"Gold," Waldo said.

57
00:03:28.784 --> 00:03:30.486
"As in gold treasure."

58
00:03:30.506 --> 00:03:31.927
"Got it."

59
00:03:32.508 --> 00:03:35.870
Ben had to use both hands to get the heavy sack off the shelf.

60
00:03:36.451 --> 00:03:38.953
He lowered it and then handed the sack to Waldo.

61
00:03:38.973 --> 00:03:43.637
"Ah-choo!" Waldo sneezed.

62
00:03:44.518 --> 00:03:48.642
Ben and Winnie immediately braced themselves, but this time nothing happened.

63
00:03:51.524 --> 00:03:52.445
Waldo grinned.

64
00:03:52.465 --> 00:03:55.408
"I think my cold is finally getting better!"

65
00:03:56.864 --> 00:04:00.546
He tipped the sack and started to pour the lizard scales into the cauldron.

66
00:04:01.026 --> 00:04:02.646
Suddenly Winnie yelped.

67
00:04:04.267 --> 00:04:05.568
"Wait! Waldo!

68
00:04:05.908 --> 00:04:07.989
Ben gave you the green scales!"

69
00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:12.631
She groaned.

70
00:04:13.511 --> 00:04:14.952
"Oh no.

71
00:04:15.392 --> 00:04:17.293
Now we'll have to start all over again."

72
00:04:17.313 --> 00:04:22.235
"But Ben shook his head in confusion as he stared at the sack.

73
00:04:22.835 --> 00:04:25.276
He was sure he'd given Waldo the right ingredient.

74
00:04:26.292 --> 00:04:29.953
"I know I grabbed the gold—" Winnie cut him off with a smile.

75
00:04:29.973 --> 00:04:34.054
"On second thought, we're good," she said.

76
00:04:34.074 --> 00:04:36.255
"We don't really need any help.

77
00:04:36.795 --> 00:04:39.976
Like my mom says, too many witches spoil the potion.

78
00:04:40.576 --> 00:04:42.677
Why don't you go see how Gaby and Mog are doing?"

79
00:04:43.457 --> 00:04:44.357
Ben blinked at her.

80
00:04:45.177 --> 00:04:48.838
He couldn't tell if she was trying to get rid of him or trying to be fair.

81
00:04:48.858 --> 00:04:52.479
"Okay," he said with a shrug.

82
00:04:52.499 --> 00:04:53.619
"See you later.

83
00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:55.240
Call if you need me."

84
00:04:58.524 --> 00:05:02.687
As he left, he noticed that the bag of green scales was still on the shelf.

85
00:05:04.148 --> 00:05:05.829
"I did get the right bag!"

86
00:05:06.149 --> 00:05:06.730
Ben thought.

87
00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:11.413
"Waldo's sneeze must have changed the gold scales to green."

88
00:05:13.274 --> 00:05:14.295
Ben felt annoyed.

89
00:05:14.815 --> 00:05:17.637
He'd tried to help Winnie, but Waldo had messed it up.

90
00:05:20.399 --> 00:05:24.582
When Ben got to the school library, Gaby and Mog were already rushing out.

91
00:05:25.783 --> 00:05:26.944
They were both grinning.

92
00:05:28.212 --> 00:05:30.113
"You two look happy," Ben said.

93
00:05:30.133 --> 00:05:31.954
"Did you find the treasure already?"

94
00:05:31.974 --> 00:05:34.636
"Nope," Mog said.

95
00:05:34.656 --> 00:05:38.198
"But Gaby thought of a really good clue."

96
00:05:38.218 --> 00:05:43.040
"I remembered that Pedro mentioned a painting," Gaby told Ben.

97
00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:47.223
"He said an artist painted him before he buried the treasure."

98
00:05:47.243 --> 00:05:50.845
"Right." Ben nodded.

99
00:05:50.865 --> 00:05:55.167
"So that painting could hold a clue to finding the treasure!"

100
00:05:55.507 --> 00:05:56.148
Gaby said.

101
00:05:56.872 --> 00:06:00.215
"We looked up information about pirate art," said Mog.

102
00:06:01.315 --> 00:06:03.597
"And we found out where that painting is."

103
00:06:03.617 --> 00:06:06.499
"Where?" Ben asked.

104
00:06:06.519 --> 00:06:10.923
"At the Monsterville Historical Society," Gaby said.

105
00:06:10.943 --> 00:06:13.344
"They've got some pirate artifacts there."

106
00:06:14.765 --> 00:06:17.227
"We're going there after school," Mog added.

107
00:06:17.247 --> 00:06:19.349
"You can come with us if you want."

108
00:06:19.369 --> 00:06:23.412
"Okay maybe," Ben said.

109
00:06:24.625 --> 00:06:26.735
"If I'm not busy helping Winnie and Waldo."
